    // ===== 占比率计算 =====

    private string GetSemiPct() => CalcPct(workOrder?.LengthStatus, semiPlans.Sum(p => (p.RequiredPieces ?? 0) * p.InputMultiple), semiPlans.Sum(p => p.RequiredWeight));
    private string GetFinishPct() => CalcPct(workOrder?.LengthStatus, finishPlans.Sum(p => p.RequiredPiece ?? 0), finishPlans.Sum(p => p.RequiredWeight));
    private string GetInvPct() => CalcPct(workOrder?.LengthStatus, inventoryPlans.Sum(p => (p.UsedQuantity ?? 0) * p.InputMultiple), inventoryPlans.Sum(p => p.UsedWeight));
    private string GetReworkPct() => CalcPct(workOrder?.LengthStatus, reworkPlans.Sum(p => (p.UsedQuantity ?? 0) * p.InputMultiple), reworkPlans.Sum(p => p.UsedWeight));
    private string GetPiercingPct() => CalcPct(workOrder?.LengthStatus, piercingPlans.Sum(p => (p.RequiredPieces ?? 0) * p.InputMultiple), piercingPlans.Sum(p => p.RequiredWeight));

    private string CalcPct(LengthStatus? lengthStatus, decimal qtySum, decimal wtSum)
    {
        if (workOrder == null) return "0%";
        var isFixed = lengthStatus == LengthStatus.Fixed;
        if (isFixed)
        {
            var total = workOrder.TotalQuantity > 0 ? workOrder.TotalQuantity : 1;
            return Math.Round(qtySum / (decimal)total * 100).ToString() + "%";
        }
        else
        {
            var total = workOrder.TotalWeight > 0 ? workOrder.TotalWeight : 1;
            return Math.Round(wtSum / total * 100).ToString() + "%";
        }
    }

